0%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">주거</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">복지</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">문화 등 청년문제에 대한 대통령 자문에 응하기 위해 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013.7</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">월에 설치된 기구입니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">금번에 또래 청년들에게 자신의 경험과 삶의 가치를 전달해 줄 수 있는 청년들을 발굴하여 또래멘토로 위촉하기 위해 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">『</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">또래멘토 모집 시즌</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">를 추진하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/ecbacd43-e397-488d-94af-5db92354cb1d.jpg\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">붙임&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">『</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">또래멘토 모집 시즌</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">신청서 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SP